2026-07-27T10:56:06.0749463Z i /tmp/RtmpSwTfYm/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:56:06.0749982Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:56:06.0750615Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:56:06.0751117Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:56:06.0751929Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:56:06.0753176Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:56:06.0754464Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
